## 11. WHAT NEVER TO DO IN THIS PROJECT

- Never use localStorage or sessionStorage for auth tokens
- Never use Daily.co, Zoom SDK, or Google Meet for video
- Never use Google Calendar API
- Never use Cal.com
- Never use SQLAlchemy or Alembic — Prisma only
- Never use plain JavaScript — TypeScript always
- Never use CSS modules or styled-components — Tailwind only
- Never store raw audio recordings at any point
- Never store patient full name in SOAP note content
- Never let patients view SOAP notes — therapist only always
- Never generate PDFs synchronously — always via Celery
- Never use a Claude model other than claude-sonnet-4-20250514
- Never write manual SQL for schema changes — Prisma only
- Never use Vercel, Railway, or Render for hosting
- Never use Stripe in this project — Paystack only
- Never use AssemblyAI in this project — Agora transcription only
- Never use Recall.ai in this project
- Never use FHIR formatting in this project
- Never build enterprise API key management in this project
- Never return role from a user-controlled request body
- Never skip RLS on any table
- Never omit risk assessment from any generated note
- Never invent information in Claude prompts — always "Not reported"

---

## 12. BEFORE WRITING ANY CODE — ALWAYS CHECK

1. Is this a patient-facing screen? If yes — mobile-first at 375px
2. Does this touch auth? If yes — check middleware + RLS + JWT claims
3. Does this touch the database? If yes — Prisma schema, RLS enforced
4. Does this involve note generation? If yes — Claude first, DeepSeek fallback, delete transcript after
5. Does this involve a background task? If yes — Celery, never synchronous
6. Does this involve payment? If yes — Paystack only, use their modal
7. Does this involve video? If yes — Agora only
8. Does this involve availability? If yes — built-in system, WAT timezone, Redis slot lock
9. Is this a Notes AI feature? If yes — wrong project, do not build it here